---
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';

const updated = 'October 3, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice | Synaptyx Manual Therapy"
  description="How the Synaptyx Manual Therapy website (formerly Total Tissue & Fitness) handles the information you share through its contact form, booking widget, and video players."
  noindex
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="PRIVACY NOTICE"
    title="Privacy & your information"
    description={`How this website handles the information you share with us. Last updated ${updated}.`}
  />
  <article class="container prose section border-top">
    <h2>Who we are</h2><p>
      This website is operated by {site.name}, formerly {site.legacyName}, at {site.address}. It
      describes our services and lets you ask a question or book a session. It is not a patient
      portal and does not hold treatment records.
    </p><h2>What we collect and why</h2><p>
      <strong>Contact form.</strong> When you send an inquiry we receive the name, email address, inquiry
      category, optional profession, and message you enter. We use them only to reply to you. Submissions
      are checked by Cloudflare Turnstile to block automated spam, then passed through our inquiry service
      to a form response sheet that only the practice can read. Please do not include medical or other
      sensitive health details in the form; we can discuss those by phone or in person.
    </p><p>
      <strong>Booking.</strong> The booking page loads a widget from Vagaro, our scheduling provider.
      Appointment details, account information, and any gift card or payment information you enter are
      collected and processed by Vagaro under its own privacy policy and terms. We see the appointment
      details needed to provide your session.
    </p><p>
      <strong>Phone calls.</strong> If you call {site.phoneDisplay}, we use your number and the
      details you give us to respond to your request.
    </p><p>
      <strong>Technical data.</strong> Like any website, our hosting provider (GitHub Pages) and Cloudflare
      may record standard server logs such as IP address, browser type, and pages requested, for security
      and operation. We do not run analytics or advertising trackers, and we do not sell or share your
      information for marketing.
    </p><h2>Cookies and third-party services</h2><p>
      This site does not set cookies of its own. Third-party services may set cookies or collect
      usage data when you use them: Vagaro (booking widget), Cloudflare Turnstile (contact form spam
      check), and YouTube (video playback). Videos load only after you choose to play them and use
      YouTube's privacy-enhanced player. Each provider's handling of your data is governed by its
      own policy.
    </p><h2>How long we keep it</h2><p>
      Inquiry responses are kept as long as needed to answer you and keep a record of the
      conversation, after which they are deleted. Booking and payment records are retained by Vagaro
      according to its policies and any legal requirements that apply to us.
    </p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>
      You can ask us what information we hold about you from this website, ask us to correct it, or
      ask us to delete inquiry messages. Call {site.phoneDisplay} or use the <a
        href={withBase('/contact/')}>contact page</a
      >. For booking records, you can also manage your Vagaro account directly.
    </p><h2>Children</h2><p>
      This website is intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect information from children
      through it.
    </p><h2>Changes</h2><p>
      We will update this page when the way the website handles information changes, and show the
      date of the latest update at the top.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
